  "note": "Pinned AIOStreams release tag used to regenerate src/data/generated/* and src/config/generated/*. `ref` MUST be a release tag and `sha` MUST be the commit that tag resolves to \u2014 scripts/sync-upstream.mjs verifies this against the remote and refuses to run otherwise, so the drift report always diffs release-to-release. Bump ref+sha+version together, run `npm run sync:upstream`, review the drift report, then commit the regenerated files with this pin.",
  "sameContractSince": "2.36.0",
  "sameContractNote": "Oldest release whose contract, for everything Core Builds emits, is identical to this pin. 2.38.0 added only things the generators never emit (listed in addedSinceSameContract; tests/upstream-additions.test.mjs fails if a generated config or the smart template uses one), so 2.36.0, 2.37.x and 2.38.x accept the same output. 2.35.9 and earlier still require an API key for anime-tosho-new (dropped in 2.36.0), so nothing older matches. tests/host-routing.test.mjs holds every non-legacy registry host to it, and PRESET_MIN_VERSIONS keeps anime-tosho-new builds off older hosts. Re-check when bumping the pin.",
  "addedSinceSameContract": {
    "configKeys": [
      "customPosterUrl"
    ],
    "presets": [
      "cinemeta",
      "xtream"
    ]
  }
}
